gyi200.athena.bob-cli-ka.1--plan","local_name":"bob-cli-ka.1--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-ka","agent_clan_generation":"20261111092449","agent_session":"bob-cli-ka.1","agent_session_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-ka.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ka[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Notebook section bullets in capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In any capture draft whose bullets land directly in a notebook body[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](a route-only `@nb` list or a `@parent^id@ %n` creation item), [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]typing `- #` or `- /` opens a Bob-authored section menu listing the[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]notebook's `##` sections (plus sections created earlier in the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]draft), accepting a row writes `- #Git` and drops the caret on the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]first nested note, and parse, menu, dry-run, and commit always [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agree on which section each note lands in.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]notebook_section_bullets.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/notebook_section_bullets.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ka[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ka/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One section resolver, a staged view, and the silent-wrong [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]resolver[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver: extend the notebook section resolver with an Ambiguous outcome[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and optional typed-capitals titles, add the staged section view (disk [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus earlier draft operations) behind parse and the glued `@nb#` menu, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stop the drawer menu and drawer probe on notebook note bullets, and fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the list summary noun.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Grammar 26 section bullets for @nb lists and %n creation[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolver[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: lex `- #Section` bullets in notebook bodies, fan their nested [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes into that section, place plain siblings in the top region (fixing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`%n` order), make a bare `#` and a bare `@nb#` incomplete, add spans, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]needs, teaching diagnostics, the `\\#` escape, docs, and the breaking [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar bump.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The notebook section menu and Bob-authored place-menu chrome[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]menu[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu: add the `notebook_section_bullet` completion context with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]title-preferring replacements, the nested continuation, provenance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]groups, note counts, consequences, refused rows, and create-row rules; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add additive `place_menu` chrome to drawer, glued notebook section, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section-bullet responses.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Notebook-aware slash alias in capture-rewrite[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]alias[dim] · [dim][/dim]after menu[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]alias: let `capture-rewrite` read notebook route frontmatter only when a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed `/` sits at a first-level bullet start, so `- /` becomes `- #` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exactly where the section menu opens and stops firing on notebook note [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail; update the help contract and alias tips.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture place menu, highlighting, and grouped preview[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar, menu, alias[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: in bob-mac-capture, generalize the drawer menu into one place menu [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]painted from Bob's chrome, open it for section bullets and glued [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook sections, keep the empty-notebook hint, group the notebook [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch preview by section, regenerate fixtures, update protocol docs, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]watch macOS CI to green.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision records and glossary[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]memory[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar, menu, alias[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory: write the section-bullet and notebook-aware-rewrite decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records, mark the partly superseded records, update the Notebook and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Task Drawer glossary entries, and regenerate the decisions docs page.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ka","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ka.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-ka.1"},"source_run_id":"run-a10ab400e23b99cdea9e29a529703c1b","